    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.pick\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHi echasnovski! Is it possible to add support for using grep and find commands of gnu utils as tools for mini.pick's grep and files builtins as fallbacks before git. This is for the case when there is no fd or rg installed.",
