    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI don't those will be added as built-in tools in 'mini.pick'. Mostly for these reasons:\r\n- I strongly suggest users to install `rg` to use in all `files`/`grep`/`grep_live` built-in pickers.\r\n- Both `find` and `grep` don't seem to be as cross platform as already present tools.\r\n- There is a 'fallback' tool which should work without needing to install any third party software. Yes, it is relatively slow, but should be enough as a fallback.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
